  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Probability of obtaining total sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo></math></p><p>Probability of getting opposite faces.</p><p>Probability of getting opposite faces</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>96</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
